 "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you? Lovely. Retrievers do love a long walk. Has he been on picknickes before? Of course. Yes? That's easy. Your dog at the picnic means a walk. Sorry, it' late arriving. Did you want to head out now, or sleep in and go morning? In for coffee first, and then we' head out. Anytime. Dog at the picnic, or home? No worries. Best to take him around the block and park him inside before getting the food. Then he can wait right outside the door.",
